221;1.2em&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;||||false|false&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h2>Artists &amp; Entrepreneurs (\u201cA&amp;E\u201d) has been established to serve as a resource for foreign designers, artists, entrepreneurs and others who want to live and work in the United States.<\/h2>\n<p>In 2025, A&amp;E had 38 O-1 approvals for a range of professions, including photographers, hair &amp; make-up artists, journalists, musicians, dancers, actresses, lighting designers, fashion\/textile designers, UX\/product designers, architectural designers, curators, and AI consultants.<\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=&#8221;2_5&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_image src=&#8221;https:\/\/artistsandentrepreneurs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/AdobeStock_304280644.jpg&#8221; show_in_lightbox=&#8221;on&#8221; use_overlay=&#8221;on&#8221; overlay_icon_color=&#8221;rgba(12,113,195,0.5)&#8221; hover_overlay_color=&#8221;rgba(0,0,0,0)&#8221; hover_icon=&#8221;&#x30;||divi||400&#8243; force_fullwidth=&#8221;on&#8221; align_tablet=&#8221;center&#8221; align_phone=&#8221;&#8221; align_last_edited=&#8221;on|desktop&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; custom_margin=&#8221;|||&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;||||false|false&#8221; filter_saturate=&#8221;25%&#8221; box_shadow_style=&#8221;preset7&#8243; box_shadow_horizontal=&#8221;0px&#8221; box_shadow_vertical=&#8221;0px&#8221; box_shadow_spread=&#8221;8px&#8221; box_shadow_color=&#8221;#ffffff&#8221; locked=&#8221;off&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/et_pb_image][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][et_pb_row _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;4_4&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_cta title=&#8221;38 O-1 Approvals in 2025&#8243; button_url=&#8221;#o1app&#8221; button_text=&#8221;Read More&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; body_font_size=&#8221;18px&#8221; background_color=&#8221;#475980&#8243; link_option_url=&#8221;#o1app&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<p>We continue to successfully process Individuals with Extraordinary Ability or Achievement (O-1)<\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_cta][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][et_pb_row column_structure=&#8221;3_5,2_5&#8243; use_custom_gutter=&#8221;on&#8221; gutter_width=&#8221;2&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;3_5&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; text_font=&#8221;Actor|&#8211;et_global_body_font_weight|||||||&#8221; text_text_color=&#8221;#000000&#8243; text_font_size=&#8221;20px&#8221; text_line_height=&#8221;1.4em&#8221; header_font=&#8221;Actor||||||||&#8221; header_text_align=&#8221;left&#8221; header_text_color=&#8221;#475980&#8243; header_font_size=&#8221;33px&#8221; header_line_height=&#8221;1.4em&#8221; header_2_font_size=&#8221;24px&#8221; header_2_line_height=&#8221;1.2em&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;||||false|false&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<p>Artists &amp; Entrepreneurs serves as a visa sponsor for those who need an agent-petitioner in the United States for O or P visa purposes. Many O and P visa applicants are self-employed and work as independent contractors. Hence, they do not have full-time employers to sponsor them.<\/p>\n<p>The O-1 agent scenario is ideal for designers, artists, and others who wish to work on a self-employed basis for multiple employers on short-term contracts or engagements. In this case, A&amp;E, as agent, will sign the O-1 visa application and will serve as the representative, for immigration purposes, of both the O-1 visa applicant and the various employers that the applicant will be working for. A schedule of engagements must be provided for the O-1 period requested.<\/p>\n<p>Another option for the agent- based O-1 is where the O-1 applicant has a full-time overseas employer who is sending them to the US and provides an employment contract and evidence of US-based work. Here, A&amp;E can serve as US agent for the overseas employer.<\/p>\n<p>A&amp;E can also facilitate where the O-1 visa applicant has a full-time US employer but that employer does not wish to sign any immigration-related paperwork. In this case, A&amp;E can serve as agent for the employer and sign the paperwork if the employer authorizes A&amp;E to do so.<\/p>\n<p>Note: A&amp;E can only serve as agent-petitioner where the O-1 visa applicant has qualified legal counsel.<\/p>\n<p>Contact us: <a href=\"mailto:info@artistsandentrepreneurs.com\">info@artistsandentrepreneurs.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=&#8221;2_5&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_image src=&#8221;https:\/\/artistsandentrepreneurs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/Jane-Orgel1-1.jpg&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; custom_padding=&#8221;13px|9px|||false|false&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/et_pb_image][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; text_font=&#8221;Actor|600|||||||&#8221; text_font_size=&#8221;17px&#8221; text_line_height=&#8221;1.8em&#8221; header_font=&#8221;Actor||||||||&#8221; header_text_align=&#8221;left&#8221; header_text_color=&#8221;#475980&#8243; header_font_size=&#8221;34px&#8221; header_line_height=&#8221;1.4em&#8221; header_2_font_size=&#8221;24px&#8221; header_2_line_height=&#8221;1.2em&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;10px||||false|false&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h2>Artists &amp; Entrepreneurs was established by veteran New York immigration attorney, Jane Orgel Esq., who has been practicing immigration law for almost 20 years.<\/h2>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][et_pb_row column_structure=&#8221;1_3,1_3,1_3&#8243; use_custom_gutter=&#8221;on&#8221; gutter_width=&#8221;2&#8243; make_equal=&#8221;on&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_3&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; background_color=&#8221;RGBA(255,255,255,0)&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_image src=&#8221;https:\/\/artistsandentrepreneurs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/AdobeStock_179464307.jpg&#8221; title_text=&#8221;AdobeStock_179464307&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; filter_saturate=&#8221;25%&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/et_pb_image][\/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_3&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_image src=&#8221;https:\/\/artistsandentrepreneurs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/AdobeStock_305724406.jpg&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; custom_padding=&#8221;||||false|false&#8221; filter_saturate=&#8221;25%&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/et_pb_image][\/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_3&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_image src=&#8221;https:\/\/artistsandentrepreneurs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/AdobeStock_202423828.jpg&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; custom_padding=&#8221;||||false|false&#8221; filter_saturate=&#8221;25%&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/et_pb_image][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][et_pb_row column_structure=&#8221;1_2,1_2&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.1