ilder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/et_pb_image][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][et_pb_row _builder_version=&#8221;4.18.0&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;4_4&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.18.0&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_divider color=&#8221;#475980&#8243; divider_weight=&#8221;15px&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/et_pb_divider][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][et_pb_row column_structure=&#8221;1_2,1_2&#8243; admin_label=&#8221;Newsletter Area&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; locked=&#8221;off&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_2&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; custom_padding=&#8221;|||&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221; custom_padding__hover=&#8221;|||&#8221;][et_pb_blurb title=&#8221;Testimonial&#8221; url=&#8221;https:\/\/artistsandentrepreneurs.com\/testimonial-photographer-james-k-lowe\/&#8221; image=&#8221;https:\/\/artistsandentrepreneurs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/JamesPortrait.jpeg&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; body_font_size=&#8221;18px&#8221; body_line_height=&#8221;30px&#8221; link_option_url=&#8221;https:\/\/artistsandentrepreneurs.com\/testimonial-photographer-james-k-lowe\/&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h1><span data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\">James K. Lowe\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/h1>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2 BCX0 SCXW419855\">James\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\">(<\/span><\/span><a class=\"Hyperlink BCX0 SCXW419855\" href=\"https:\/\/jamesklowe.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><span data-contrast=\"none\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun Underlined BCX0 SCXW419855\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\" data-ccp-charstyle=\"Hyperlink\">https:\/\/jamesklowe.com<\/span><\/span><\/a><span data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\">)\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2 BCX0 SCXW419855\">is<\/span><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\"> a<\/span><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\">n acclaimed Photographer<\/span><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\">.<\/span><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\"> He received his MFA from <\/span><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\">Elam School of Fine Arts<\/span><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\">, <\/span><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\">University of Auckland<\/span><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\"> in 2017. <\/span><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\">We filed <\/span><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\">Mr. Lowe<\/span><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\">\u2019s<\/span><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\"> first O-1 case <\/span><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\">on<\/span><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\"> <\/span><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\">January 20,<\/span><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\"> <\/span><span class=\"NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2 BCX0 SCXW419855\">202<\/span><span class=\"NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2 BCX0 SCXW419855\">2<\/span><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\"> and it was approved <\/span><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\">on February 17, 2022<\/span><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX0 SCXW419855\">. <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_blurb][et_pb_button button_url=&#8221;https:\/\/artistsandentrepreneurs.com\/testimonial-photographer-james-k-lowe\/&#8221; button_text=&#8221;Read More&#8221; button_alignment=&#8221;center&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; custom_button=&#8221;on&#8221; button_text_color=&#8221;#ffffff&#8221; button_bg_color=&#8221;#3bcb2b&#8221; button_border_color=&#8221;#3bcb2b&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/et_pb_button][\/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_2&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_blurb title=&#8221;Testimonial&#8221; url=&#8221;https:\/\/artistsandentrepreneurs.com\/testimonial-chef-julie-myrtille\/&#8221; image=&#8221;https:\/\/artistsandentrepreneurs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/Chef-Julie-Myrtille-and-Melanie-Roy-1-1024&#215;683.jpg&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; body_font_size=&#8221;18px&#8221; body_line_height=&#8221;30px&#8221; link_option_url=&#8221;https:\/\/artistsandentrepreneurs.com\/testimonial-chef-julie-myrtille\/&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h1>Chef, Julie Myrtille<\/h1>\n<p>In March 2020, French pastry chef, Julie Khim Tewes (\u201cJulie Myrtille\u201d) and her sister and manager, Melanie Khim Tewes, received three-year renewals of their O-1 and O-2 visas in just seven days through Artists &#038; Entrepeneurs Inc. Entrepreneurs Julie and Melanie run their own pastry store in Austin, Texas and create a whole line of pastries&#8230;.<\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_blurb][et_pb_button button_url=&#8221;https:\/\/artistsandentrepreneurs.com\/testimonial-chef-julie-myrtille\/&#8221; button_text=&#8221;Read More&#8221; button_alignment=&#8221;center&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; custom_button=&#8221;on&#8221; button_text_color=&#8221;#ffffff&#8221; button_bg_color=&#8221;#3bcb2b&#8221; button_border_color=&#8221;#3bcb2b&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/et_pb_button][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][\/et_pb_section][et_pb_section fb_built=&#8221;1&#8243; admin_label=&#8221;Sponsors Section&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; background_color=&#8221;#FFFFFF&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;||||false|false&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_row _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;4_4&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.23.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; header_2_font=&#8221;|700|||||||&#8221; header_2_font_size=&#8221;32px&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h1 class=\"p2\"><strong>Opportunities for Artists<\/strong><\/h1>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][et_pb_row _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;4_4&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.23.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; text_font_size=&#8221;16px&#8221; link_option_url=&#8221;https:\/\/lmcc.net\/september-2024-grantee-events\/?mc_cid=3648d1f6e2&#038;mc_eid=7e65ed79fc&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<p>To explore various opportunities for artists, including upcoming residencies, fellowships, grants, and exhibition open calls, please visit the <strong>Opportunities for Artists<\/strong> section on the Lower Manhattan Cultural Council (LMCC) website. For more information, refer to the details in the linked section provided by the LMCC.<\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][et_pb_button button_url=&#8221;https:\/\/lmcc.net\/september-2024-grantee-events\/?mc_cid=3648d1f6e2&#038;mc_eid=7e65ed79fc&#8221; button_text=&#8221;Read More&#8221; button_alignment=&#8221;left&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.23.4&#8243; custom_button=&#8221;on&#8221; button_text_size=&#8221;15px&#8221; button_text_color=&#8221;#000000&#8243; button_bg_color=&#8221;#EDF000&#8243; button_border_color=&#8221;#EDF000&#8243; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/et_pb_button][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][et_pb_row _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;4_4&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_divider _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/et_pb_divider][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][et_pb_row column_structure=&#8221;1_2,1_2&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_2&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_image src=&#8221;https:\/\/artistsandentrepreneurs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/6985069C-3849-4AB4-AB39-8394CDDB9307_1_105_c-2.jpeg&#8221; title_text=&#8221;6985069C-3849-4AB4-AB39-8394CDDB9307_1_105_c (2)&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/et_pb_image][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h3>Amelie Held<\/h3>\n<p><strong><span>Organist Amelie Held graduated with an Artist Diploma from The Juilliard School in New York and obtained a 3 year O-1 visa through Artists &amp; Entrepreneurs in May 2024.<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span>Known for her red organ shoes, organist Amelie Held quickly became an internationally acclaimed artist. She regularly performs on stages in Europe and the United States. Her solo concert activities include performances at the Gewandhaus Leipzig, the Philharmonie Essen, the Konzerthalle Bamberg, the Konzerthaus Dortmund, the Helsinki Music Center and the St. Petersburg Mariinsky Concert Hall as well as major cathedrals in the world\u2019s most important music centres, such as Leipzig, Hamburg, L\u00fcbeck, Milan, Paris, Zurich, London, Boston and New York City.\u00a0Raised in Munich, Germany, in a non-musician family, Amelie released her debut album at the young age of 22 and has won several prizes at international organ competitions. She was one of the youngest finalists of the prestigious French Concours International de Chartres (2018She has a broad repertoire, both as a soloist and with orchestra and chamber ensemble, ranging from early music to contemporary compositions as well as her own transcriptions. <\/span>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_2&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_image src=&#8221;https:\/\/artistsandentrepreneurs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/0785B337-9E28-42C7-A1E8-F549D6AC0497_1_105_c.jpeg&#8221; title_text=&#8221;0785B337-9E28-42C7-A1E8-F549D6AC0497_1_105_c&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/et_pb_image][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][\/et_pb_section][et_pb_section fb_built=&#8221;1&#8243; admin_label=&#8221;Newsletter Section&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; background_color=&#8221;#ededed&#8221; background_enable_image=&#8221;off&#8221; parallax=&#8221;on&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;20px||20px||true|false&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_row column_structure=&#8221;1_4,1_4,1_4,1_4&#8243; admin_label=&#8221;Newsletter Area&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; locked=&#8221;off&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_column _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; type=&#8221;1_4&#8243;][et_pb_blurb title=&#8221;Testimonial&#8221; url=&#8221;https:\/\/artistsandentrepreneurs.com\/cellist-pedro-bonet-gonzalez\/&#8221; image=&#8221;https:\/\/artistsandentrepreneurs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/Pedro-Bonet-Gonzalez.jpg&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; link_option_url=&#8221;https:\/\/artistsandentrepreneurs.com\/cellist-pedro-bonet-gonzalez\/&#8221; hover_enabled=&#8221;0&#8243; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221; title_text=&#8221;Pedro Bonet Gonzalez&#8221; sticky_enabled=&#8221;0&#8243;]<\/p>\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\">Cellist, Pedro Bonet Gonzalez<\/h1>\n<p><b><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Pedro Bonet Gonzalez<\/span><\/b><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> is a Spanish Cellist\u00a0with a Master of Music degree from the Manhattan School of Music. His O-1 was approved with Premium Processing in 15 business days, and in September 2026, he received the O-1 visa stamp in his passport. This was an agent-based O-1 through Artists &amp; Entrepreneurs Inc.\u00a0<\/span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Pedro has performed solo with the RTVE Symphony Orchestra\u00a0and for Instituto\u00a0Cervantes in collaboration with the Consulate General of Spain in New York and Spain Cultural New York.<\/span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">After receiving his O-1,\u00a0Pedro wrote:<\/span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b><i><span data-contrast=\"auto\">I\u2019m incredibly grateful to Jane Orgel for making my O-1 visa process so smooth, efficient, and stress-free. Her professionalism, attention to detail, responsiveness, and deep understanding of the music industry were key throughout the process, and I couldn\u2019t be happier with the outcome<\/span><\/i><\/b><span data-contrast=\"auto\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_blurb][et_pb_button button_url=&#8221;https:\/\/artistsandentrepreneurs.com\/cellist-pedro-bonet-gonzalez\/&#8221; button_text=&#8221;Read More&#8221; button_alignment=&#8221;center&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; custom_button=&#8221;on&#8221; button_text_color=&#8221;#ffffff&#8221; button_bg_color=&#8221;#34db34&#8243; button_border_color=&#8221;rgba(0,0,0,0)&#8221; button_icon_color=&#8221;#7cda24&#8243; background_layout=&#8221;dark&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;||0px|||&#8221; hover_enabled=&#8221;0&#8243; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221; sticky_enabled=&#8221;0&#8243;][\/et_pb_button][\/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_4&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_blurb title=&#8221;Testimonial&#8221; url=&#8221;https:\/\/artistsandentrepreneurs.com\/flutist-hyeonjeong-choi\/&#8221; image=&#8221;https:\/\/artistsandentrepreneurs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/image3.jpeg&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; link_option_url=&#8221;https:\/\/artistsandentrepreneurs.com\/flutist-hyeonjeong-choi\/&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\">Flutist, Hyeonjeong Choi<\/h1>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><strong>Hyeonjeong Choi<\/strong>\u00a0is a Korean flutist\u00a0with Master of Music degrees from Rice University and Yale University. Her O-1 was approved in\u00a0<\/span><b><span data-contrast=\"auto\">August 2026<\/span><\/b><span data-contrast=\"auto\">\u00a0using premium processing. This was an agent- based O-1 through Artists &amp; Entrepreneurs Inc.<\/span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Hyeonjeong\u00a0has performed as a section flutist with the Houston Symphony Orchestra and the New World Symphony.\u00a0<\/span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">After receiving her O-1, Hyeonjeong wrote:\u00a0<strong>\u201c<\/strong><\/span><b><span data-contrast=\"auto\">I\u2019m incredibly grateful to Jane and her team for helping me successfully obtain my O-1 visa as a professional flutist. Throughout the entire process, they were knowledgeable, responsive, and supportive, and made what initially felt like an overwhelming process much more manageable. I truly appreciate all of their guidance and highly recommend Jane Orgel to other artists pursuing an O-1 visa!\u201d<\/span><\/b><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_blurb][et_pb_button button_url=&#8221;https:\/\/artistsandentrepreneurs.com\/flutist-hyeonjeong-choi\/&#8221; button_text=&#8221;Read More&#8221; button_alignment=&#8221;center&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; custom_button=&#8221;on&#8221; button_text_color=&#8221;#ffffff&#8221; button_bg_color=&#8221;#34db34&#8243; button_border_color=&#8221;rgba(0,0,0,0)&#8221; button_icon_color=&#8221;#7cda24&#8243; background_layout=&#8221;dark&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;||0px|||&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/et_pb_button][\/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_4&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_blurb title=&#8221;Testimonial&#8221; url=&#8221;https:\/\/artistsandentrepreneurs.com\/interactive-artist-video-designer-wei-fang-chang\/&#8221; image=&#8221;https:\/\/artistsandentrepreneurs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/2.png&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; link_option_url=&#8221;https:\/\/artistsandentrepreneurs.com\/interactive-artist-video-designer-wei-fang-chang\/&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\">Interactive Artist\/ Video Designer, Wei-fang Chang<\/h1>\n<p><strong>Wei-fang Chang<\/strong><span>\u00a0<\/span>is a Taiwanese new media artist\/ video designer. Her O-1 was approved in<span>\u00a0<\/span><strong>May 2026<\/strong><span>\u00a0<\/span><strong>with Premium Processing<\/strong>. Wei-Fang has worked for clients across the U.S. and Taiwan, including CalArts, REDCAT, LA Dance Project, Odyssey Theatre Ensemble, The Tank NYC, MOCA Taipei, Taipei Performing Arts Center, and National Taichung Theater. She also freelances as a TouchDesigner developer and collaborates on interactive programming with studios such as NightLight Labs (LA), One to 13 Studio (NY), AARTIFACT Studio (NY), and LuxuryLogico (TW).<\/p>\n<p>After receiving her O-1, Wei-fang wrote: \u201cI had my O-1 visa approved<strong><span>\u00a0<\/span>on the first try<\/strong><span>\u00a0<\/span>as a video designer and interactive artist. Throughout the application process, Rongrong was consistently responsive and professional. I highly recommend Jane Orgel PC to any creative looking to pursue the O-1! \u201d<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_blurb][et_pb_button button_url=&#8221;https:\/\/artistsandentrepreneurs.com\/interactive-artist-video-designer-wei-fang-chang\/&#8221; button_text=&#8221;Read More&#8221; button_alignment=&#8221;center&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.4&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; custom_button=&#8221;on&#8221; button_text_color=&#8221;#ffffff&#8221; button_bg_color=&#8221;#34db34&#8243; button_border_color=&#8221;rgba(0,0,0,0)&#8221; button_icon_color=&#8221;#7cda24&#8243; background_layout=&#8221;dark&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;||0px|||&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/et_pb_button][\/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_4&#8243; _builder_version=